      "rationale": "The module composes the whole artifact line in artifact_line: the one line before the message that names the text file and, when the reference carries a complete hand-over, that second file too — calling handover_file_line for the path/digest fragment and keeping the legacy one-file line for a receipt without it. It also writes and restores the text artifact itself. It does not format the second file's path and digest; that fragment is role_handover_file.handover_file_line.",
